### TeamForge Phase 11 API Tests (REST Client Format)
### Phase 1 Removal: Project Health Telemetry & Impression/Preview Tracking Removed
### Kept Features: Owner Response Time, Deadline Cascade & Open Task Shifting, Capacity Guard, 3-Day Join Request Reminder

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@superUserToken = Bearer YOUR_SUPERUSER_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@ownerToken = Bearer YOUR_OWNER_TOKEN_HERE
@collabToken = Bearer YOUR_COLLABORATOR_TOKEN_HERE

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. REMOVED ROUTES (Return 404 Not Found)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1a. Impression Tracking Removed
# Expected Status: 404 Not Found
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/impression
Authorization: {{collabToken}}

###

### 1b. Preview Tracking Removed
# Expected Status: 404 Not Found
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/preview
Authorization: {{collabToken}}

###

### 1c. Project Health Removed
# Expected Status: 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/health
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. PUBLIC OWNER RESPONSE TIME TELEMETRY (Kept)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2a. Get Owner Response Time (Public Numbers Only)
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Expected Response: { medianHours: N, sample: N }
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1/response-time

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. DEADLINE CASCADE & OPEN TASK SHIFTING (Kept)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3a. Extend Project Deadline with Task Shifting Enabled
# Expected Status: 200 OK
# Shifts open tasks forward by diffDays, leaves Approved tasks untouched
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/deadline
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-user-role: project-owner

{
  "dueDate": "2027-02-15T00:00:00.000Z",
  "reason": "Scope extension requested by collaborators with owner approval.",
  "shiftTasks": true
}

###

### 3b. Extend Project Deadline without Task Shifting
# Expected Status: 200 OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1/deadline
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-user-role: project-owner

{
  "dueDate": "2027-03-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "reason": "Final wrap-up phase timeline extension.",
  "shiftTasks": false
}

###

### --------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. CAPACITY GUARD: TEAM SIZE CANNOT BE BELOW ACTIVE MEMBERS (Kept)
### --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4a. Attempt to Reduce Team Size Below Current Active Members (Rejected)
# Expected Status: 409 Conflict
# Expected Error Code: TEAM_SIZE_BELOW_MEMBERS
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-user-role: project-owner

{
  "teamSize": 0
}

###

### 4b. Update Team Size Within Valid Range
# Expected Status: 200 OK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/proj-1
Authorization: {{ownerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-user-id: 1
x-user-role: project-owner

{
  "teamSize": 6
}
